<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - ING lowered at Goldman.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - ING lowered at Goldman.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch financial services group ING Group NV was cut to &quot;market outperformer&quot; from &quot;priority list&quot; at Goldman Sachs, the investment bank said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Analysts at Goldman were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
